  "termsAndPrivacy": "Terms & Conditions and Privacy Policy",
  "policyDialogSubtitle": "Review how BayanTrack handles community reports and protects your account",
  "termsPolicyContent": "BAYANTRACK TERMS & CONDITIONS\n\n1. Purpose\nBayanTrack helps residents send community reports to their barangay and follow the progress of concerns that affect their neighborhood.\n\n2. Use the service responsibly\nUse your own account and submit reports about real community concerns. Do not upload abusive, unlawful, discriminatory, or deliberately misleading content.\n\n3. Reports and evidence\nDescribe what happened, where it happened, and when it happened as accurately as you can. Only share photos, videos, and other evidence that you are allowed to share. BayanTrack may route a report and its evidence to authorized barangay or city personnel for review and action.\n\n4. Account security\nKeep your email address and password private. You are responsible for activity made through your account. Contact the BayanTrack team if you believe your account has been accessed by someone else.\n\nBAYANTRACK PRIVACY POLICY\n\n1. Information we receive\nWe collect the details you provide when you register, including your name, email address, and selected barangay. We also receive the report details, location, attachments, and updates you choose to submit.\n\n2. How we use your information\nWe use this information to verify accounts, route reports to the right barangay, send status updates, prevent misuse, and improve BayanTrack's community reporting service.\n\n3. Who may access it\nRelevant report details may be viewed by authorized BayanTrack administrators and local government personnel who need the information to review or respond to the concern. We do not sell your personal information.\n\n4. Your choices\nPlease keep your account information accurate and tell us if it needs to be corrected. We keep information only for as long as it is needed for service operations, reporting history, safety, and applicable requirements.\n\nBy tapping Accept, you confirm that you have read and understood the BayanTrack Terms & Conditions and Privacy Policy.",
